  "description": "Experience the thrill of coastal living at Howth’s most prestigious new rental address – Claremont – Luxury Seafront Living. \r\n\r\nVisit ClaremontHowth.ie or apply below to schedule your viewing today!\r\n\r\nClaremont: Luxury Seafront Living - Breathtaking Views in Howth’s Prime Location\r\nThis new residential development in the heart of Howth offers a modern luxury  lifestyle in a beautiful natural setting. Located close to the train station, Claremont is a 25 minute DART ride to the city centre and close to many other great towns along the north Dublin coast. Howth itself is a charming and picturesque village with a wide variety of cafés, restaurants, and shops at your doorstep, providing an idyllic setting for everyday living.\r\n\r\nLuxury Apartments Finished to the Highest Standards\r\nPrepare to live in luxury at Claremont, where every apartment is crafted to the highest standards, designed with a focus on quality, style and functionality to ensure your home is both stylish and practical. Featuring generous spaces, curated interiors featuring open-plan living areas that combine comfort and style, and floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the apartments with natural light while offering breathtaking sea views. \r\n\r\nFirst-Class Amenities for a Lifestyle of Comfort\r\nAt Claremont, luxury living isn’t just about the homes – it’s about a lifestyle. The development is professionally managed and offers an unrivaled array of first-class amenities, thoughtfully designed to enhance your lifestyle. Amenities include a 300 sq m professional standard fitness centre. Whether you're a fitness enthusiast or someone who prefers a more relaxed workout, the gym is fully equipped to cater to all your needs.\r\n\r\nFor those looking to unwind, the residents’ lounge offers a stylish and comfortable space to relax or socialise. Claremont also features coworking spaces, ideal if you prefer the flexibility of working remotely without sacrificing productivity. Landscaped courtyards provide peaceful spots where you can enjoy some fresh air, surrounded by nature’s beauty. And when it's time for some fun, the games room offers a variety of entertainment options for residents. \r\n\r\nClaremont: A New Standard in Coastal Living\r\nWhether you’re seeking the perfect retreat from the hustle and bustle of city life or a vibrant community close to everything Dublin has to offer, Claremont offers the best of both worlds. It’s a place where every detail has been considered for your comfort, convenience, and enjoyment.\r\nSleep in your home – live in your building! \r\n\r\n\r\n**Please note: 1) There are multiple property types available in this development. Rents will vary throughout the development depending on the specific property type. Not all the available properties and rents are listed here; please use those available at viewings. 2) The photos shown here may not be of the actual unit available but represent the standard of finish throughout the development.",
